WEBVTT

00:00:12.190 --> 00:00:15.480
I won't go easy on you just 
because you're my junior.

00:00:18.960 --> 00:00:21.150
When I play, I play to win.

00:00:21.150 --> 00:00:23.000
We're not gonna lose!

00:00:28.270 --> 00:00:30.240
Very well. Let's begin!

00:00:39.380 --> 00:00:41.350
Hey, Grea?

00:00:41.640 --> 00:00:43.630
Are we really going to do this?

00:00:44.350 --> 00:00:47.250
Like, for real? Really?

00:00:59.660 --> 00:01:03.450
MYSTERIA FRIENDS

00:01:04.060 --> 00:01:09.910
FLOATING AT SEA

00:01:05.840 --> 00:01:08.460
Wow! Check out the great view!

00:01:10.190 --> 00:01:11.590
It's really beautiful.

00:01:14.620 --> 00:01:19.200
Being in such a wonderful place all 
alone with you, it's just so romantic!

00:01:19.200 --> 00:01:21.790
W-what are you talking about, Anne?

00:01:22.240 --> 00:01:26.140
Well now that we've seen the sights, 
I think it's time to go back.

00:01:26.470 --> 00:01:27.430
Not yet.

00:01:29.070 --> 00:01:31.270
Our final destination is farther that way.

00:01:34.210 --> 00:01:35.710
Come on, let's go.

00:01:35.710 --> 00:01:37.110
Jeez...

00:01:51.870 --> 00:01:53.400
Just you wait...

00:01:57.670 --> 00:01:59.390
Hey, Grea?

00:01:59.810 --> 00:02:01.940
Let's just go back, okay?

00:02:01.940 --> 00:02:03.890
We've already come too far.

00:02:04.390 --> 00:02:08.140
To be honest, I love being 
alone together with you.

00:02:08.610 --> 00:02:11.110
It's really wonderful, but...

00:02:12.750 --> 00:02:14.250
We're almost there.

00:02:16.050 --> 00:02:17.490
Ugh, ugh, ugh!

00:02:17.490 --> 00:02:18.950
Ugh! Ugh!

00:02:18.950 --> 00:02:21.240
Anne, you're making it hard to walk.

00:02:21.240 --> 00:02:23.200
Because I want to go back!

00:02:24.770 --> 00:02:27.160
Are you sure you want to give up?

00:02:35.380 --> 00:02:37.260
Where are you touching me!

00:02:37.260 --> 00:02:39.520
I'm not touching anything!

00:02:41.120 --> 00:02:44.310
Jeez, you're the one who came 
up with this idea, Anne!

00:02:47.740 --> 00:02:50.270
Okay, then let's spend tonight together, too.

00:02:50.270 --> 00:02:51.530
Sure, sure.

00:02:51.530 --> 00:02:53.600
They say the stars are 
really pretty out here.

00:02:53.600 --> 00:02:55.330
Let's gaze at them together.

00:02:55.330 --> 00:02:56.460
Sure, sure.

00:02:56.460 --> 00:02:57.940
We can light off some fireworks, too!

00:02:57.940 --> 00:02:59.450
Sure, sure.

00:02:59.450 --> 00:03:01.370
And have a sleepover together.

00:03:01.370 --> 00:03:02.510
Sure, su-

00:03:02.510 --> 00:03:03.530
Huh?!

00:03:04.910 --> 00:03:07.290
I brought our matching pajamas!

00:03:07.980 --> 00:03:09.410
No way, absolutely not!

00:03:09.410 --> 00:03:11.460
Too late, it's decided!

00:03:15.220 --> 00:03:16.880
I'll take the lead.

00:03:30.890 --> 00:03:32.070
Beautiful...

00:03:33.980 --> 00:03:35.520
It's a nice spot, don't you think?

00:03:47.420 --> 00:03:49.430
Fantastic!

00:03:56.350 --> 00:03:58.700
You just know all the best places, Grea!

00:03:58.700 --> 00:04:01.050
Nobody will bother us out here.

00:04:12.860 --> 00:04:14.900
So, are you ready to get started?

00:04:15.430 --> 00:04:19.860
La-de-da! La-de-dum!

00:04:20.550 --> 00:04:22.010
What are you doing?

00:04:22.010 --> 00:04:23.550
Making a sand castle!

00:04:23.550 --> 00:04:25.550
How about you join me, Grea?

00:04:30.970 --> 00:04:32.690
Anne, hurry up and take this off.

00:04:34.160 --> 00:04:35.600
Come on, get moving.

00:04:36.840 --> 00:04:38.200
But...

00:04:39.290 --> 00:04:41.150
No buts!

00:04:41.150 --> 00:04:43.830
Fine, then you take it off for me.

00:04:43.830 --> 00:04:45.200
You can't be serious!

00:05:02.240 --> 00:05:03.690
You're not half bad.

00:05:03.990 --> 00:05:05.790
We're not done yet!

00:05:12.920 --> 00:05:15.390
Okay, now let's really get started.

00:05:15.390 --> 00:05:16.920
Started with what?

00:05:17.640 --> 00:05:19.940
Practice. That's what you wanted, isn't it?

00:05:22.320 --> 00:05:25.090
You told me you would be embarrassed 
if anybody found out.

00:05:25.090 --> 00:05:26.930
That's the whole reason we came out here.

00:05:30.860 --> 00:05:33.180
Come on, strip down to your swimsuit.

00:05:36.770 --> 00:05:37.850
Strip down.

00:05:42.380 --> 00:05:43.780
Fine...

00:06:19.560 --> 00:06:20.650
What do you think?

00:06:20.650 --> 00:06:23.370
Anne, you're not supposed to use magic.

00:06:23.370 --> 00:06:27.900
But why? I shouldn't have to struggle 
to swim if I can just walk on the water!

00:06:28.770 --> 00:06:29.660
No magic.

00:06:42.650 --> 00:06:46.050
Here we go...!

00:06:46.050 --> 00:06:48.950
Here we go...!

00:07:02.260 --> 00:07:05.190
It's okay. I'm here for you.

00:07:05.540 --> 00:07:08.150
But my feet can't even touch the bottom here!

00:07:08.620 --> 00:07:09.780
Just calm down.

00:07:10.830 --> 00:07:12.870
Let's start by having you float.

00:07:12.870 --> 00:07:14.140
Float?!

00:07:14.140 --> 00:07:16.870
Humans weren't made to float!

00:07:16.870 --> 00:07:19.050
It's okay, just try it.

00:07:19.780 --> 00:07:22.670
Okay, Anne? Just breathe in slowly.

00:07:24.320 --> 00:07:25.390
Now out.

00:07:26.770 --> 00:07:28.120
Breathe in.

00:07:29.440 --> 00:07:30.740
Now out.

00:07:36.310 --> 00:07:37.970
You need to relax more.

00:08:01.330 --> 00:08:02.570
It's okay.

00:08:04.010 --> 00:08:07.040
Don't be nervous. Just let yourself relax.

00:08:10.120 --> 00:08:11.620
You don't have to worry.

00:08:22.850 --> 00:08:25.370
Okay, look at the sky now.

00:08:25.370 --> 00:08:27.230
Keep your arms and legs loose.

00:08:32.520 --> 00:08:34.050
You can't let your body get stiff like that.

00:08:35.050 --> 00:08:37.320
Relax your arms and legs.

00:08:37.820 --> 00:08:43.240
Relax... relax... relax...

00:08:45.670 --> 00:08:47.070
Now open your eyes.

00:10:20.750 --> 00:10:24.190
So, this is what floating is like.

00:10:24.190 --> 00:10:25.030
Yeah.

00:10:33.490 --> 00:10:35.880
Thank you, Grea.

00:11:36.470 --> 00:11:41.010
Episode 7:
 Hide-and-Seek

00:11:36.470 --> 00:11:41.010
Mysteria Friends, episode 7: Hide-and-Seek.

00:11:41.010 --> 00:11:46.010
Illustration by: Enarein

00:11:50.590 --> 00:11:54.010
Are we really supposed to hold 
these fireworks in our hands?

00:11:54.660 --> 00:11:56.860
They're apparently from 
another land out in the east.

00:11:56.860 --> 00:11:59.860
Ms. Miranda ordered them especially for us.

00:12:00.270 --> 00:12:02.640
Isn't this kind of dangerous?

00:12:02.640 --> 00:12:04.570
Huh? It's fine, don't worry.

00:12:04.900 --> 00:12:09.330
Whenever you say that is exactly 
when something dangerous happens.

00:12:10.740 --> 00:12:13.320
We can see the stars now, but you're 
still going to do fireworks?

00:12:13.790 --> 00:12:15.840
Do they not do that in your country, Grea?

00:12:16.430 --> 00:12:17.540
Not really.

00:12:17.980 --> 00:12:19.810
I've heard that since ancient times,

00:12:19.810 --> 00:12:22.720
fireworks have been used mainly 
in times of celebration.

00:12:22.720 --> 00:12:24.550
I can't wait to see them!

00:12:24.550 --> 00:12:29.390
Fireworks are more fun if you aim them 
at someone when you set them off.

00:12:32.300 --> 00:12:34.530
Well then, let's get started!

00:12:57.190 --> 00:12:59.940
DO NOT ATTEMPT

00:13:28.040 --> 00:13:30.370
What do you want to do next, Grea?

00:13:30.700 --> 00:13:31.550
Huh?

00:13:31.550 --> 00:13:33.370
We're all out of fireworks.

00:13:33.850 --> 00:13:35.860
They were a lot of fun, huh?

00:13:36.140 --> 00:13:36.820
Yeah.

00:13:37.170 --> 00:13:41.090
It's kind of a shame we already 
have to go back tomorrow.

00:13:41.570 --> 00:13:42.940
I think so, too.

00:13:42.940 --> 00:13:46.680
But we managed to do everything 
that we wanted to.

00:13:46.680 --> 00:13:48.650
All that's left is the sleepover!

00:13:48.650 --> 00:13:49.550
Huh?!

00:13:50.040 --> 00:13:52.250
I really put in a lot of effort today!

00:13:53.290 --> 00:13:55.740
It took so much work to get here!

00:13:56.830 --> 00:13:59.440
But now it's finally time 
for our matching pajamas!

00:13:59.440 --> 00:14:00.560
Wait just a second!

00:14:01.080 --> 00:14:04.030
I'm so excited to sleep next to you!

00:14:04.730 --> 00:14:05.880
No way...

00:14:06.530 --> 00:14:08.310
we absolutely cannot.

00:14:08.310 --> 00:14:09.200
Anne...

00:14:09.200 --> 00:14:12.010
The morning sun is waiting for us!

00:14:12.010 --> 00:14:16.240
I keep telling you... no way!
